    "description": {
      "value": "<p>\n  An \"arm\" in name only, the Arc-Thrower is a massive electricity cannon. 0\n  option slots.\n</p>\n<p>\n  The Arc-Thrower is One-Handed Exotic Poor Quality Shotgun that uses Heavy\n  Weapons Skill. Fires \"Shotgun Shell\" electricity blast with 4d6 damage.\n  Critical Injuries are not possible. Armor is not ablated. If target goes under\n  1HP from the blast, target has 1HP and is Unconscious.\n</p>\n<p>\n  Firing the Arc-Thrower consumes a charge from the included Radline MagnaSlot\n  BatteryBrick (100eb). BatteryBrick has a 32 shot capacity and can be recharged\n  in 1 hour. Use an Action to swap in a fresh battery pack even if user has no\n  free hands available. Arc-Thrower does not have a hand attachment.\n</p>\n"
